    "text": "Leave a 🤎 below to affirm! \n\nBreathe. You haven’t met all of you yet. There is still so much life left for you. So much beauty. So many unexpected turns.\n\nSending love to everyone entering this last week of May trying to protect their peace, reconnect with themselves, and believe in better days again. \n\nAnd if you’ve been needing a reminder lately: you are not behind in your own life. 🫶🏽\n\nFor more daily empowerment, order our book *Not Sure Who Needs to Hear This, But…* now at wetheurban.com (more in bio). \n\nWritten by @williegreene_",
